flowchart TB
  Internet --> DNS[Route 53 + TLS]
  DNS --> ALB[Public ALB]
  ALB --> NGINX[NGINX ingress / rate limit]
  NGINX --> API[ECS API tasks in private subnets]
  API --> RDS[(RDS PostgreSQL private subnet)]
  API --> S3[(S3 private access endpoint)]
  API --> Outbox[Outbox relay ECS service]
  Outbox --> SQS[SQS + DLQ]
  SQS --> Workers[ECS worker service / autoscale on backlog]
  Workers --> S3
  Workers --> RDS
  Workers --> LLM[Allowlisted provider egress]
  API --> CW[CloudWatch + OpenTelemetry collector]
  Workers --> CW
  Secrets[Secrets Manager + task IAM roles] -. inject at runtime .-> API
  Secrets -. inject at runtime .-> Workers
